graph TD
    User([User]) --> Wrapper["HRAgentWrapper (AdkApp)"]
    Wrapper -->|Delegates via stream_query| Orchestrator["Orchestrator Agent (LlmAgent)"]
    
    subgraph "HR Agent System"
        Orchestrator -->|Routes Policy Queries| Policy[Policy Agent]
        Orchestrator -->|Routes Benefits Queries| Benefits[Benefits Agent]
        Orchestrator -->|Routes Payroll Queries| Payroll[Payroll Agent]
        Orchestrator -->|Routes Onboarding Queries| Onboarding[Onboarding Agent]
        
        Policy -->|Uses| SearchTool[Policy Search Tool]
        Benefits -->|Uses| BenefitsTool[Benefits Info Tool]
        Payroll -->|Uses| PayrollTool[Payroll Lookup Tool]
    end
    
    Orchestrator -->|Returns Final Response| Wrapper
    Wrapper -->|Aggregates Events| User
